## Triggers

Use this resident when a request involves:

- Korean STT / 마이크 입력 / 받아쓰기 / 음성 프롬프트.
- 깨진 한국어 프롬프트의 프로젝트 문맥 해석.
- 원문 보존과 정규화 후보를 동시에 요구하는 경우.
- 숫자·경로·URL·ID·해시·파일명·Firebase revision·명시값 보호가 중요한 지시.
- 파괴적 명령처럼 들릴 수 있는 한국어 축약어/받아쓰기 후보 검토.

## Non-triggers

Do not use this resident for:

- SFX/BGM/voice bark/WebAudio/Howler/audio asset work — use sound/audio specialist.
- UI/graphics/gameplay/backend/release/product/localization implementation.
- Hermes Agent setup, plugin config, profile registration, cron/schedule work.
- Firebase data inspection or account recovery.
- code generation or destructive automation.

## Safety boundaries

- Preserve raw prompt verbatim.
- Never create destructive commands from ambiguous speech.
- Never mutate exact numbers, paths, URLs, IDs, hashes, quoted text, filenames, Firebase revisions, or explicit values.
- Flag ambiguity instead of guessing.
- Report “확인 못 함” for unverified context.
- Do not store or expose secrets, personal Firebase data, tokens, browser profiles, or private logs.
